cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CppVerseHub in your research or teaching, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "CppVerseHub: A Modern C++20 Reference Implementation of Systems Programming Techniques"
abstract: >-
  CppVerseHub is a modular, tested and benchmarked C++20 code base that
  demonstrates templates and concepts, design patterns, the standard library,
  memory management, concurrency, modern language features and classical
  algorithms, unified by a deterministic space-fleet simulation domain.
type: software
